d 'MMWSL': module for implementing longitudinal marginal mean weighting through stratification for time-varying binary or nominal treatments
d
d  mmwsl extends marginal mean weighting through stratification
d (mmws) to panel (longitudinal) data with a time-varying
d treatments (see Hong 2015). When specified, inverse probability
d of treatment weights (IPTW) will also be computed, following
d Robins, Hernan, and Brumback (2000). Treatments can be either
d binary or nominal. 
d
d KW: marginal mean weighting through stratification
d KW: inverse probability of treatment weights
d KW: time-varying treatment
d KW: causal inference
d
d Requires: Stata version 11
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260917
d
d Author: Ariel Linden, Linden Consulting Group, LLC
d Support: email alinden@@lindenconsulting.org
d
f mmwsl.ado
f mmwsl.sthlp
f mmws.ado
f mmws.sthlp
f ../p/pstrata.ado
f ../p/pstrata.sthlp
f mmwsl_example.dta
f MMWSL.pdf
